      "cue": "adv_voice_mujica_002_1_02_095",
      "sourceType": "story",
      "sha256": "f6111dd52ff0ba87da61e0dde36aa02691b2581e27ed90a4c66f4b231d9805a3",
      "nativeSha256": "b3569c9d8f826ae5d69ee0f707c2fbc1cd53fbf0ea801075d66fe3ff9e576fee",
      "bytes": 351026,
      "seconds": 3.979,
      "path": "assets/voices/source_adv_voice_mujica_002_1_02_095.wav",
      "subtitle": "——你愿意，将剩余的人生交给我吗？"
    },
    {
      "slug": "sakiko",
      "provider": "bdon.moe",
      "speaker": "sakiko",
      "speakerId": "adv_sakiko",
      "text": "这是最后通牒。\n今后不准再跟我扯上关系",
      "textId": "adv_script_mygo_001_1_14_174",
      "pageUrl": "https://bdon.moe/story/10013",
      "index": 845,
      "url": "https://assets.bdon.moe/zh-Hans/Cri/Sound/adv_voice_mygo_001_1_14/adv_voice_mygo_001_1_14_152.m4a",
      "cue": "adv_voice_mygo_001_1_14_152",
      "sourceType": "story",
      "sha256": "a0a205e12efb412c362db392e3f51acf9a8c422b326c7dbf1e08cd2e21bf7632",
      "nativeSha256": "aa230c2f13d252c19c1a95f2ee651bf9ff00a42ae31003d3fcc4d053111638bc",
      "bytes": 533400,
      "seconds": 6.047,
      "path": "assets/voices/source_adv_voice_mygo_001_1_14_152.wav",
      "subtitle": "这是最后通牒。\n今后不准再跟我扯上关系"
    },
    {
      "slug": "sakiko",
      "provider": "bdon.moe",
      "speaker": "sakiko",
      "speakerId": "adv_sakiko",
      "text": "我哪里误会了？\n你说的话和做的事互相矛盾",
      "textId": "adv_script_mygo_001_1_14_157",
      "pageUrl": "https://bdon.moe/story/10013",
      "index": 752,
      "url": "https://assets.bdon.moe/zh-Hans/Cri/Sound/adv_voice_mygo_001_1_14/adv_voice_mygo_001_1_14_135.m4a",
      "cue": "adv_voice_mygo_001_1_14_135",
      "sourceType": "story",
      "sha256": "5152be4cfc8976c6bd781cf62d2050dc3d7dd851635397a0be0a07f3ca280918",
      "nativeSha256": "5fdaa51b6f4b9b1876f42331506975456a8892178e8af6733fb8184bbf208ab1",
      "bytes": 385224,
      "seconds": 4.367,
      "path": "assets/voices/source_adv_voice_mygo_001_1_14_135.wav",
      "subtitle": "我哪里误会了？\n你说的话和做的事互相矛盾"
    },
    {
      "slug": "sakiko",
      "provider": "bdon.moe",
      "speaker": "sakiko",
      "speakerId": "adv_sakiko",
      "text": "你究竟怎么想的？\n为什么要做那样下作的事？",
      "textId": "adv_script_mujica_002_1_03_4",
      "pageUrl": "https://bdon.moe/story/10022",
      "index": 54,
      "url": "https://assets.bdon.moe/zh-Hans/Cri/Sound/adv_voice_mujica_002_1_03/adv_voice_mujica_002_1_03_003.m4a",
      "cue": "adv_voice_mujica_002_1_03_003",
      "sourceType": "story",
      "sha256": "5b34d8b04e606c3f62417a90b3564ae1cccd6f54e91640702d5d33b20401e578",
      "nativeSha256": "27d0a4386859f63b292e9252369a2c527371128dc1327321a3091be377f43082",
      "bytes": 353392,
      "seconds": 4.006,
      "path": "assets/voices/source_adv_voice_mujica_002_1_03_003.wav",
      "subtitle": "你究竟怎么想的？\n为什么要做那样下作的事？"
    },
    {
      "slug": "sakiko",
      "provider": "bdon.moe",
      "speaker": "sakiko",
      "speakerId": "adv_sakiko",
      "text": "到现在还执着于过去，真不像话。\n你也该忘记了吧？",
      "textId": "adv_script_mygo_001_1_14_149",
      "pageUrl": "https://bdon.moe/story/10013",
      "index": 709,
      "url": "https://assets.bdon.moe/zh-Hans/Cri/Sound/adv_voice_mygo_001_1_14/adv_voice_mygo_001_1_14_127.m4a",
      "cue": "adv_voice_mygo_001_1_14_127",
      "sourceType": "story",
      "sha256": "800aef48bd908f316fcd25e6d6a4bdc5e37d15e9dc1d10f04ee4807017a7d1ec",
      "nativeSha256": "879e16942a50cd94e55ca97ee1fa19cde7c3ffeab75bc545b4fae6c9fd077679",
      "bytes": 606278,
      "seconds": 6.873,
      "path": "assets/voices/source_adv_voice_mygo_001_1_14_127.wav",
      "subtitle": "到现在还执着于过去，真不像话。\n你也该忘记了吧？"
    },
    {
      "slug": "sakiko",
      "provider": "bdon.moe",
      "speaker": "sakiko",
      "speakerId": "adv_sakiko",
      "text": "……是我自己的问题",
      "textId": "adv_script_mygo_001_1_01_13",
      "pageUrl": "https://bdon.moe/story/10000",
      "index": 215,
      "url": "https://assets.bdon.moe/zh-Hans/Cri/Sound/adv_voice_mygo_001_1_01/adv_voice_mygo_001_1_01_013.m4a",
      "cue": "adv_voice_mygo_001_1_01_013",
      "sourceType": "story",
      "sha256": "ca6186ff304079e65053352c94b0708b2f5b9d8c248731ae782b91fc25b411de",
      "nativeSha256": "8b31e89b9211b87e153e3c6cbe6c96213850c2a3878454ae6bf66e425de03b7a",
      "bytes": 162720,
      "seconds": 1.844,
      "path": "assets/voices/source_adv_voice_mygo_001_1_01_013.wav",
      "subtitle": "……是我自己的问题"
    },
    {
      "slug": "sakiko",
      "provider": "bdon.moe",
      "speaker": "sakiko",
      "speakerId": "adv_sakiko",
      "text": "……我要退出CRYCHIC",
      "textId": "adv_script_mygo_001_1_01_7",
      "pageUrl": "https://bdon.moe/story/10000",
      "index": 167,
      "url": "https://assets.bdon.moe/zh-Hans/Cri/Sound/adv_voice_mygo_001_1_01/adv_voice_mygo_001_1_01_007.m4a",
      "cue": "adv_voice_mygo_001_1_01_007",
      "sourceType": "story",
      "sha256": "58e773d6cda10e0e36e7b1139e4d1c797077b1df39ae58e2b9d11c8ac28dd5c9",
      "nativeSha256": "ee57a1f7f2b835429f95f5433ddff71f9a58fff5e073152959088f3b1be92534",
      "bytes": 324038,
      "seconds": 3.673,
      "path": "assets/voices/source_adv_voice_mygo_001_1_01_007.wav",
      "subtitle": "……我要退出CRYCHIC"
    },
    {
      "slug": "sakiko",
      "provider": "bdon.moe",
      "speaker": "sakiko",
      "speakerId": "adv_sakiko",
      "text": "……就算我不在你们也能练习吧？",
      "textId": "adv_script_mygo_001_1_01_24",
      "pageUrl": "https://bdon.moe/story/10000",
      "index": 293,
      "url": "https://assets.bdon.moe/zh-Hans/Cri/Sound/adv_voice_mygo_001_1_01/adv_voice_mygo_001_1_01_024.m4a",
      "cue": "adv_voice_mygo_001_1_01_024",
      "sourceType": "story",
      "sha256": "b79cc255399d937bdd98d08f18b36c1f4cd45a7a2cf75dbd0ea64c9003ae38ad",
      "nativeSha256": "cfa6389290aca2fe1d1f02275a82480176bfadac3a6e48df8557194b1d7fe6f4",
      "bytes": 198692,
      "seconds": 2.252,
      "path": "assets/voices/source_adv_voice_mygo_001_1_01_024.wav",
      "subtitle": "……就算我不在你们也能练习吧？"
    },
    {
      "slug": "sakiko",
      "provider": "bdon.moe",
      "speaker": "sakiko",
      "speakerId": "adv_sakiko",
      "text": "想练习的话自己练不就好了。\n又没有规定练习必须全员到齐。\n……不要怪到别人身上",
      "textId": "adv_script_mygo_001_1_01_26",
      "pageUrl": "https://bdon.moe/story/10000",
      "index": 300,
      "url": "https://assets.bdon.moe/zh-Hans/Cri/Sound/adv_voice_mygo_001_1_01/adv_voice_mygo_001_1_01_026.m4a",
      "cue": "adv_voice_mygo_001_1_01_026",
      "sourceType": "story",
      "sha256": "815570f6b295c10dd1411ccdcd3443781d158c28a98c816145a2967f47f9c6f1",
      "nativeSha256": "41711bd47476021e1c94ba017fda8493d70dd9280350b881563f72cf13ca669a",
      "bytes": 620214,
      "seconds": 7.031,
      "path": "assets/voices/source_adv_voice_mygo_001_1_01_026.wav",
      "subtitle": "想练习的话自己练不就好了。\n又没有规定练习必须全员到齐。\n……不要怪到别人身上"
    },
    {
      "slug": "sakiko",
      "provider": "bdon.moe",
      "speaker": "sakiko",
      "speakerId": "adv_sakiko",
      "text": "不要讲这种撒娇的话！\n灯，你是最需要练习的人，\n但你至今都在做什么？",
      "textId": "adv_script_mygo_001_1_01_28",
      "pageUrl": "https://bdon.moe/story/10000",
      "index": 324,
      "url": "https://assets.bdon.moe/zh-Hans/Cri/Sound/adv_voice_mygo_001_1_01/adv_voice_mygo_001_1_01_028.m4a",
      "cue": "adv_voice_mygo_001_1_01_028",
      "sourceType": "story",
      "sha256": "5d819a81183d68238865ac22f75b2372dfa3ddaf946513aa6216b40e44f1ebb0",
      "nativeSha256": "44166a5f016bb43c8e4bee0846feffa386f22b75bf72a62423618cc4f320db83",
      "bytes": 642616,
      "seconds": 7.285,
      "path": "assets/voices/source_adv_voice_mygo_001_1_01_028.wav",
      "subtitle": "不要讲这种撒娇的话！\n灯，你是最需要练习的人，\n但你至今都在做什么？"
    },
    {
      "slug": "sakiko",
      "provider": "bdon.moe",
      "speaker": "sakiko",
      "speakerId": "adv_sakiko",
      "text": "想演奏是你们的自由。\n你们就请便吧",
      "textId": "adv_script_mygo_001_1_14_147",
      "pageUrl": "https://bdon.moe/story/10013",
      "index": 700,
      "url": "https://assets.bdon.moe/zh-Hans/Cri/Sound/adv_voice_mygo_001_1_14/adv_voice_mygo_001_1_14_125.m4a",
      "cue": "adv_voice_mygo_001_1_14_125",
      "sourceType": "story",
      "sha256": "9c55143dd234dd3eace9e687d0ed208718efc60a3148f7565ef5d67a5b3b43ba",
      "nativeSha256": "0c4ce1c8e021ed5094b13293571f17801809037f9368019765275783510bfd40",
      "bytes": 334422,
      "seconds": 3.791,
      "path": "assets/voices/source_adv_voice_mygo_001_1_14_125.wav",
      "subtitle": "想演奏是你们的自由。\n你们就请便吧"
    },
    {
      "slug": "sakiko",
      "provider": "bdon.moe",
      "speaker": "sakiko",
      "speakerId": "adv_sakiko",
      "text": "CRYCHIC已经毁了。\n绝对不可能再复活",
      "textId": "adv_script_mygo_001_1_14_159",
      "pageUrl": "https://bdon.moe/story/10013",
      "index": 759,
      "url": "https://assets.bdon.moe/zh-Hans/Cri/Sound/adv_voice_mygo_001_1_14/adv_voice_mygo_001_1_14_137.m4a",
      "cue": "adv_voice_mygo_001_1_14_137",
      "sourceType": "story",
      "sha256": "210e80259163a901c4099e1f43a24fe39df8251383d4c21d5fe3ba12b19c745b",
      "nativeSha256": "287fb8dcb763bfd753b26c904f693ddfb2155443a2334406b9417176e670ad9e",
      "bytes": 423792,
      "seconds": 4.804,
      "path": "assets/voices/source_adv_voice_mygo_001_1_14_137.wav",
      "subtitle": "CRYCHIC已经毁了。\n绝对不可能再复活"
    },
    {
      "slug": "sakiko",
      "provider": "bdon.moe",
      "speaker": "sakiko",
      "characterId": 10,
      "text": "读书的时间让人很放松呢。如果还有红茶的话就更好了",
