      "path": "assets/voices/source_BandTop_Sakiko_Spring_01.wav",
      "subtitle": "睦，头发上沾到樱花花瓣了哦。好了，拿下来了"
    },
    {
      "slug": "sakiko",
      "provider": "bdon.moe",
      "speaker": "sakiko",
      "characterId": 10,
      "text": "初华说因为春天来了所以想改变一下房间布置，感觉很忙的样子",
      "textId": "Talk_Text_194",
